Third-party material bundled in this repository
===============================================

Source code vendored into this repository, with its upstream licence and the
attribution its licence requires. The full licence texts are kept beside each
vendored copy; the provenance of every file (upstream path, revision and the
modifications made) is in the file's own header and in the directory's
README.md. Binary and model dependencies that are resolved at build time rather
than vendored are recorded in docs/licensing/third-party-register.md.

