Speaker and segmentation model weights (model-pack tier, EPIC P)
Distributed as an offline model pack, never inside the application binary.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Neither file below is bundled in Plaudon today: the voice-profiles feature is
off by default and its ADR-0081 §4 gates are not all passed, so no release
installs them. The attribution each one obliges is recorded here because the
obligation attaches to the model pack we build and to any screen that displays
the model, not to a future decision to ship — and because the digests below are
the only ones the installer will accept (crates/ai-speaker/src/checkpoint.rs,
docs/licensing/third-party-register.md).

